      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Additional note:\n\nThis particular \"leak\" only occurs when the large VRCUrl arrays are declared within the UdonBehaviour itself, rather than set as a public per-instance variable.\n\nFor now, using a public variable array with the URLs serialized seems to work around the issue (albeit more difficult to work with at the array sizes I'm working at).\n\nEDIT:\n\nWhen not using a contrived example, and instead using something with the intended use-case with more references, Serialized VRCUrl arrays still appeared to leak, albeit slower. I'm not sure why they weren't before.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
