      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After further testing today, I would like to note that this ballooning memory behavior seems extremely inconsistent.\n\nDuring my testing yesterday, the test world linked above would significantly expand VRChat's memory usage nearly every time I rejoined, and I didn't see any sign of it ever leveling off.\n\nToday, memory usage still started at ~3.8GiB, but it consistently plateaued after the ~4th or ~5th launch at 6.25GiB.\n\nSame version of VRChat, etc. so I have no idea what the difference is. Unfortunately I do not have the VRC logs from yesterday, but I'll attempt to compare the memory allocation lines if it happens again.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
